Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.89,0:00:13.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.05,0:00:17.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you carry me all the way up here?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.11,0:00:20.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn right I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.63,0:00:21.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it wasn't easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.87,0:00:24.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe a thank you, or a...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.83,0:00:25.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.57,0:00:27.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How disgusting!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.93,0:00:29.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're completely drenched in sweat!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.83,0:00:31.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you have stained my garments!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.25,0:00:33.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you follow them up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.37,0:00:35.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding?
