Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.97,0:02:23.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where is your partner?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.73,0:02:25.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, his name's Eugeo.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.87,0:02:27.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine, Eugeo.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.59,0:02:28.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He is not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.89,0:02:33.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From the cloud-top garden,\Nthere is a stairway leading up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.95,0:02:38.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before reaching this floor, however, he\Nwould have had to face our strongest knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.73,0:02:40.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and who would that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.57,0:02:42.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.48,0:02:44.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or rather, Commander Bercouli.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.93,0:02:48.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh man, now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.09,0:02:54.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.03,0:02:56.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,System call.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.23,0:02:57.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Generate Umbra Element.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.75,0:02:59.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Adhere Possession.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.05,0:03:03.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Object ID, WLSS-703.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.73,0:03:05.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Discharge.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.05,0:03:07.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing that for?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.07,0:03:11.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to find where\Nthe Blue Rose Sword is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.15,0:03:13.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I can find it, I'm gonna find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.85,0:03:16.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's under us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.51,0:03:20.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.89,0:03:25.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did this, I take it? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.93,0:03:30.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I managed to stop the bleeding, but\Nmy sacred arts can only do so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.11,0:03:34.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think you can\Nheal your eye yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.73,0:03:40.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.11,0:03:43.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is not enough\Nsacred power in the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.95,0:03:46.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I cannot repair it until Solus has risen.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.19,0:03:51.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am still feeling some pain, and\Ndepth perception will be an issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.23,0:03:54.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But neither will keep me from fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.81,0:03:55.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.55,0:03:57.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.01,0:04:00.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish to feel this pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.83,0:04:04.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is the proof of my\Nresolve to fight the church.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.31,0:04:06.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.73,0:04:08.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.59,0:04:15.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.29,0:04:20.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if we're ever in battle, I'll\Nmake sure to protect your right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.43,0:04:40.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is Eugeo the one responsible for this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.43,0:04:42.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure it was him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.87,0:04:46.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, remember how he activated\Nperfect control on us before?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.75,0:04:49.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To be honest, I didn't\Nthink it was this powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.39,0:04:53.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can't be. Uncle!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.41,0:04:57.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.31,0:05:02.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uncle!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.97,0:05:06.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.93,0:05:08.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eugeo didn't do that to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.21,0:05:12.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He did not, but I have an idea who did.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.81,0:05:14.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.72,0:05:17.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uncle told me that Prime\NSenator Chudelkin had
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.89,0:05:20.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,been granted the authority\Nto turn anyone to stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.43,0:05:23.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An art called Deep Freeze.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.97,0:05:24.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.88,0:05:27.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But they're supposed\Nto be on the same side.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.65,0:05:29.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would he betray\None of his own knights?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.81,0:05:30.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doesn't make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.85,0:05:36.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think Uncle secretly harbored doubts\Nabout the orders issued by the Senate.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.97,0:05:37.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.19,0:05:39.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.10,0:05:43.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he believed there could be no peace in\Nthe realm without the rule of the Church.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.73,0:05:46.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So he continued to perform\Nhis duties regardless.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.61,0:05:55.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The senator may have all\Nthe authority, but this…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.29,0:05:58.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is no reason to\Ntreat him so horribly!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.91,0:06:00.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Son! Uncle!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.69,0:06:10.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uncle!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.60,0:06:12.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you mustn't try to move!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.91,0:06:15.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll destroy yourself! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.21,0:06:21.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.77,0:06:24.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you cut out that crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.51,0:06:26.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A smile suits you better.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.37,0:06:28.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uncle!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.67,0:06:30.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.58,0:06:34.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess you made it over that wall, kiddo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.63,0:06:37.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For 300 years, I tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.75,0:06:40.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Couldn't break the seal. But you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.61,0:06:41.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.03,0:06:44.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't just leave you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.95,0:06:47.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you fuss over me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.03,0:06:49.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm happy for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.29,0:06:52.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're stronger than ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.27,0:06:54.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing left for me to teach you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.99,0:06:56.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.17,0:06:57.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.65,0:07:00.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is so much I need to learn from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.21,0:07:02.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know all you need.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.07,0:07:07.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If anyone can guide this world to\Nwhere it ought to be, it's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.31,0:07:11.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, punk.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.03,0:07:15.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look after her for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.99,0:07:17.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.29,0:07:25.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to find your partner,\NPrime Senator Chudelkin?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.65,0:07:27.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He took him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.69,0:07:31.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heading to the Pontifex's chamber.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.35,0:07:38.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, hurry before the kid gets\Ntrapped in the maze of his memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.53,0:07:44.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.07,0:07:54.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.51,0:08:16.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some have tried to wield two\Nswords before, mostly pretentious.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.33,0:08:20.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,upper-class noblemen looking to\Nimpress you oddly enough seem
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.39,0:08:25.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,rather imposing oh you think I\Ncan't imagine fighting with two
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.59,0:08:27.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,swords though that'd be crazy
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.99,0:08:34.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all right by all accounts we must
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.47,0:08:39.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,assume the pontifex has eugeo by\Nnow when she speaks one cannot
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.29,0:08:43.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,resist her words are a web which\Nentangle the mind like some kind
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.37,0:08:45.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of hypnotist you talked to her
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.25,0:08:50.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,before only once it was six years
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.55,0:08:54.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ago i remember waking up and\Nthe Pontifex standing before me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.35,0:08:59.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She said she ruled the human empire\Non behalf of the gods and had
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.23,0:09:01.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,summoned me to serve their will.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.87,0:09:05.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her eyes were like mirrors,\Nsilver, and reflective.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.69,0:09:09.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did not realize it at\Nthe time, but I do now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.29,0:09:13.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was terrified of her, and\NI knew I could not defy her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.31,0:09:18.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would accept every word she said\Nand serve her with all of my being.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.33,0:09:21.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fear was absolute.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.15,0:09:25.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It compelled me to obey,\Nand like a coward, I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.79,0:09:27.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.17,0:09:32.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.55,0:09:34.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know what I must do now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.93,0:09:37.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the sake of my sister\Nliving in the North,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.97,0:09:43.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for my family and the citizens of this\Nrealm, I will do what I believe is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.37,0:09:45.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We must hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.31,0:09:49.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time is short, and we still\Nhave to reach the Pontifex.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.15,0:09:53.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Prime Senator will try to\Nstop us, so prepare yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.83,0:09:55.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what about the commander?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.43,0:09:57.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't leave him like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.97,0:10:01.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we catch Chudelkin, we can\Nforce him to reverse the spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.19,0:10:05.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or we can kill him and\Nsolve the problem that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.93,0:10:10.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey. Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.03,0:10:14.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mentioned this Prime Senator\NChudelkin guy a few times.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.25,0:10:17.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what's the deal\Nwith the other senators?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.23,0:10:23.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To be honest, none of us Integrity\NKnights have ever seen the other Senators.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.81,0:10:27.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know they are located\Nabove the 96th floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.63,0:10:30.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We Knights are not allowed there, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.13,0:10:32.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what these Senators do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.45,0:10:34.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They monitor the realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.65,0:10:35.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From their chamber,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.07,0:10:38.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they observe the words\Nand deeds of every citizen
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.81,0:10:42.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to ensure they are not\Nviolating the Taboo Index.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.37,0:10:46.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When someone runs afoul of the taboos,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.41,0:10:50.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they note the violation and\Nsend a knight to deal with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.53,0:10:54.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So basically, they're pretty much\Nthe eyes and ears of the Pontifex.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.95,0:10:55.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.87,0:10:57.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if Administrator's a control freak,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.87,0:11:01.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's hard to believe she'd give\Nanyone that much authority.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.17,0:11:05.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this where they are?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.95,0:11:07.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, it should be.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.17,0:11:19.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is a sacred art.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.21,0:11:22.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doesn't sound like an attack spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.03,0:11:25.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.63,0:11:43.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're all just heads. Look again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.53,0:11:45.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their bodies seem to be attached.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.61,0:11:57.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was a senator. Have\Nyou seen one before?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.87,0:12:01.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yeah back at the academy\Nright after we fought
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.35,0:12:05.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Rios and Humber, he\Nappeared out of nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.99,0:12:44.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These miserable creatures\Nare the Senators?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.47,0:12:46.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a horrifying fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.61,0:12:48.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did the Pontifex do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.35,0:12:49.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's my bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.17,0:12:51.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These were once normal people.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.37,0:12:54.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Probably good at the sacred arts, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.75,0:12:57.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She kidnapped them and turned\Nthem into these things.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.81,0:13:00.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unforgivable.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.67,0:13:04.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.73,0:13:09.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This will not. Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.13,0:13:14.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Prime Senator...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.11,0:13:15.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Judelkin.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.45,0:13:19.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This cannot be happening!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.63,0:13:27.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This won't do! No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.83,0:13:29.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It simply will not do!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.75,0:13:32.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.57,0:13:49.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you attempt to initiate an art, I will\Ncut your tongue right out of your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.51,0:13:51.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That nerve!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.29,0:13:53.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait just a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.11,0:13:56.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should have died in\Nthe fall with that traitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.33,0:13:58.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you alive, Number 30?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.35,0:13:59.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am not a number.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.49,0:14:03.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Alice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.29,0:14:05.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am no longer number 30.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.15,0:14:08.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.06,0:14:11.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you here? Number...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.29,0:14:12.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean Alice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.89,0:14:15.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is your sword not embedded in him?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.31,0:14:16.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.59,0:14:21.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a heretic, a traitor, a pawn\Nof the Dark Territory! You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.29,0:14:22.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He is a traitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.79,0:14:25.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he is not from the Dark Territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.43,0:14:27.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That I can assure you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.75,0:14:30.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You miserable knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.61,0:14:32.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wish to betray us too!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.77,0:14:35.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I tell you to do\Nsomething, you damn well do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.95,0:14:37.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are nothing but a puppet!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.61,0:14:38.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All you knights are!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.25,0:14:42.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Axiom Church turned us into puppets.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.27,0:14:46.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sealed away our memories\Nthrough the Synthesis ritual,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.37,0:14:50.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,forced us to be loyal\Nto you and the Church,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.63,0:14:54.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,made us believe the myth that we were\Nknights summoned from the heavens.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.17,0:14:58.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, you are correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.79,0:15:03.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I remember the day we turned\Nyou like it was yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.53,0:15:09.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were so young, so innocent, so cute,\Nbegging as tears streamed down your cheeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.41,0:15:14.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, don't take away my\Nmemories of all the people I love!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.99,0:15:16.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't make me forget!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.71,0:15:19.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.62,0:15:20.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,just thinking about it again is going to
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.07,0:15:23.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,keep me awake all night\Nlaughing hysterically.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.51,0:15:25.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As I recall,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.97,0:15:28.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you were brought here\Nfrom some backwater town
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.33,0:15:30.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and trained as an\Napprentice for two years.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.53,0:15:32.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were so rebellious!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.77,0:15:36.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once you snuck out to see the\NMidsummer Festival like a tomboy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.87,0:15:38.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That said,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.29,0:15:42.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you studied hard, believing against all\Nhope that one day you'd return home again?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.01,0:15:44.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.97,0:15:46.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's because,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.75,0:15:49.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,once you've raised your system\Ncontrol authority level high enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.95,0:15:52.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's forced synthesis time!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.27,0:15:57.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should have seen your face when you\Nrealized you'd never see your home again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.29,0:16:00.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted to turn you to\Nstone so I could display
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.29,0:16:02.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your precious grief in my chamber forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.99,0:16:08.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mentioned something odd just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.07,0:16:10.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forced synthesis?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.65,0:16:15.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you mean to say the ritual can\Nbe undertaken voluntarily as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.75,0:16:18.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My, my, what sharp ears you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.39,0:16:19.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're absolutely correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.53,0:16:24.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Six years ago, you were\Nso unbelievably stubborn,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.67,0:16:29.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you refused to recite the secret commands\Nfor the typical synthesis ritual.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.89,0:16:33.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honestly, you were the most\Ninsufferable brat imaginable.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.63,0:16:38.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gave me no choice but to divert the\Nautomated senators from their normal duties,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.39,0:16:43.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then have them conduct a ritual to pry the\Ndoor open to your most precious memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.77,0:16:46.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was a bother, but I shouldn't complain.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.69,0:16:49.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got to see an incredible show!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.13,0:16:53.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's talking way too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.21,0:16:55.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.07,0:16:57.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like he's stalling.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.31,0:17:01.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prime Senator Chudelkin,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.03,0:17:05.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you had a lifetime of\Namusement from my suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.87,0:17:08.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, at the end, I hope you are satisfied.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.59,0:17:15.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have had enough of your dribble.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.49,0:17:17.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.59,0:17:31.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.25,0:17:34.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ritual is not all I'm good at!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.25,0:17:37.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.29,0:17:39.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.43,0:17:43.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,System call!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.87,0:17:45.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Generate humanist enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.53,0:17:47.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be on guard for a surprise attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.61,0:17:48.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.99,0:17:53.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was chanting from here a moment ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.77,0:17:57.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The hundredth floor is above\Nus, so perhaps he fled there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.09,0:17:58.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.00,0:18:01.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't see stairs anywhere. Do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.35,0:18:13.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great, another Integrity Knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.65,0:18:15.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, that can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.71,0:18:31.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eugeo!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.89,0:18:33.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.75,0:18:34.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.19,0:18:36.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.73,0:18:38.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too soon for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.31,0:18:39.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The synthesis ritual.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.55,0:18:47.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your friend seems to have\Nalready been synthesized.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.83,0:18:49.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He is?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.85,0:18:52.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way. You sure? I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.39,0:18:54.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do not know how it is possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.67,0:18:57.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He fought the commander only an hour ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.47,0:18:59.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then it's not possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.65,0:19:01.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait. Not him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.53,0:19:03.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.11,0:19:06.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do not lose your wits now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.33,0:19:10.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is still a chance we can\Nsave you, Geo. There is? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.67,0:19:12.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You told me so yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.95,0:19:16.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You discovered a way to restore\Nan Integrity Knight's memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.05,0:19:19.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Therefore, it should apply to him as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.85,0:19:24.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The important thing now is you stay\Ncalm and get hold of yourself. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.09,0:19:30.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me handle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.81,0:19:33.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.39,0:19:34.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.63,0:19:37.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He is not the person you once knew. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.97,0:19:43.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eugeo, you remember who I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.51,0:19:44.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.05,0:19:46.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm your best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.21,0:19:50.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've been together ever since\Nwe left Rulid two years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.79,0:19:52.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.23,0:19:54.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.01,0:19:57.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.43,0:19:59.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.91,0:20:01.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For returning my sword to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.45,0:20:12.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Incarnate arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.69,0:20:13.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How'd he do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.60,0:20:16.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He used an ancient art\Ntaught to Integrity Knights.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.85,0:20:19.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is neither sacred\Nart nor perfect control.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.91,0:20:22.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It allows one to move objects at will.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.31,0:20:27.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only a handful of knights, including\NUncle, have the skill to use it, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.25,0:20:32.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is not something a newly created\Nknight like Eugeo could have mastered.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.55,0:20:35.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.53,0:20:37.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.17,0:20:40.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will fight the both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.53,0:20:42.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is what my lady wishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.49,0:20:43.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.05,0:20:45.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going to fight me, your friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.03,0:20:47.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All because she told you to?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.53,0:20:49.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's no reason to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.49,0:20:52.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is reason enough for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.41,0:20:54.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She gives me everything I ever wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.93,0:20:57.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And she is all I'll ever need now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.83,0:20:59.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.99,0:21:01.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about Alice?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.51,0:21:02.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you remember her?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.67,0:21:06.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.83,0:21:08.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I don't want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.23,0:21:10.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care who either of you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.77,0:21:11.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've had enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.53,0:21:13.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Snap out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.13,0:21:25.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arm yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.49,0:21:27.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am done talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.09,0:21:35.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't remember,
